stone golem (which can't be hit by the rubber chicken) or the iron
golem (which can breathe gas).  The mind flayer scores about a 2 or 3
on the scale ... so why does the game rate the glass golem as such a
dangerous enemy?  I've been killed by soldier ants, elves, giant ants,
killer bees, unicorns, soldiers with death rays, starvation, angry
gods, kicking chests, but never a glass golem.

